sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as API client
    participant API as cmd/api
    participant Rules as Rule service
    participant Compiler as Rule compiler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>API: POST /v1/rules/{ruleSet}/revisions
    API->>Rules: Activate(tenantScope, ruleSet, source, actor)
    Rules->>Compiler: Compile(source)

    alt Source is invalid
        Compiler-->>Rules: Validation error
        Note over Compiler: Checks limits, duplicate rule ids,<br/>ambiguous priorities, match mode,<br/>otherwise placement and action shape
        Rules-->>API: Error
        API-->>Client: 4xx with error body
    else Source is valid
        Compiler-->>Rules: Immutable RuleRevision with compiled rules and content hash
        Rules->>DB: Save rule revision, immutable row
        Rules->>DB: Set active revision for tenant and rule set
        DB-->>Rules: RuleActivation with version and actor
        Rules-->>API: RuleActivation
        API-->>Client: 200 OK with activation payload
    end

    Note over DB: Rule revisions are immutable.<br/>Activation selects one revision per tenant and rule set.<br/>Events evaluate against the active revision only.
